   "body": "mac/lot-110 did not claim this lot. It implements FEAT-002 (#146), a UX proposal by Bybifok. The operator decision of 2026-10-28 (docs/FEATURES.md, UX principles: preserve legacy UX, changes only if proposed and supported by the community) says his UX/UI proposals are not implemented; only his bug findings stay in scope. The legacy app has no equivalent page navigator beyond the 'last 3 pages' picker. #146 is still 'status: needs-triage' and the FEAT-002 spec does not exist.\n\nDecision needed (operator): drop LOT-110 / FEAT-002 as a Bybifok UX proposal, or confirm it is wanted (then it can be claimed, ideally as an opt-in or legacy-preserving addition).",
